[{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_07070000_04_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_07070000_04_0010","text":"饮料\n…………就这个吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_07070000_04_0020","text":"还有……————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_07070000_04_0030","text":"────！\n好吵……什么────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_07070000_04_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_07070000_04_0032","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_07070000_04_0040","text":"────！\n美、美琴小姐……！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_07070000_04_0050","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_07070000_04_0060","text":"……那个、请问……！\n啊哈哈……！那个，是玩具吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_07070000_04_0070","text":"……嗯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_07070000_04_0080","text":"哇——！还带弹珠汽水呢！\n是会叫的玩偶啊——……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_07070000_04_0090","text":"嗯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_07070000_04_0100","text":"……上面写着“请按这里”，所以……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_07070000_04_0110","text":"好、好的……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_07070000_04_0120","text":"我一按，它就叫了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_07070000_04_0130","text":"……！\n噗……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_07070000_04_0131","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_07070000_04_0140","text":"那个、不不……！\n上面确实写着“按吧”！……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_07070000_04_0150","text":"嗯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_07070000_04_0160","text":"……呵呵\n啊哈哈……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_07070000_04_0170","text":"那个，请把它放进购物篮里吧……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_07070000_04_0180","text":"……\n你要买这个？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_07070000_04_0190","text":"是的，那个……怎么说呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_07070000_04_0200","text":"感觉就是“为了买这个而来的”！……！"}]
